  "_comment": [
    "Hand-written, and no command rewrites it. `mise run drift:update` touches",
    "coverage/*-baseline.json and coverage/*-coverage.json; coverage/evidence.json is",
    "rewritten only by `mise run evidence:update`. Neither writes this file, so an edit",
    "here survives both.",
    "",
    "Read by TestEveryOperationHasExactlyOneDomain (internal/cli/domains_test.go), which",
    "fails in both directions: an operation in coverage/evidence.json that no domain owns,",
    "and a domain entry naming an operation the record does not have.",
    "",
    "The issue numbers are the parity issues #409 to #415. They are CLOSED, and are kept",
    "as the names the maintainer asked for on #874; the live work is tracked per axis in",
    "#427 and #428."
